      "markdown": "<a id='bbad6a1d-5c11-4e5b-a862-18d8dd1f2125'></a>\n\n1. Ensure there are no other shipping or tracking labels attached to your package. Select the Print button on the print dialogue box that appears. Note: If your browser does not support this function, select Print from the File menu to print the label.\n2. Fold the printed label at the solid line below. Place the label in a UPS Shipping Pouch. If you do not have a pouch, affix the folded label using clear plastic shipping tape over the entire label.\n3. GETTING YOUR SHIPMENT TO UPS\nCustomers with a scheduled Pickup\n* Your driver will pickup your shipment(s) as usual.",
      "type": "text"
    },
